<title>BELGIUM: Belgium drains liquidity at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgium drains liquidity at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank drained liquidity from the money market at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances on Monday. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date 04/09	  expiry on 11/09    NBVA</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   14.500 bln bfr    (15.575 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    14.500 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  100</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on 04/09</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on 26/08</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810</p>
</text>
